# Localization (SPA)

Seven locales: `src/i18n/locales/{en,id,ja,ko,zh-CN,ar,ru}.json`. English is the source.

- **Never `Read` an entire locale JSON file.** Grep the key, `StrReplace` it in all seven files, run `npm run check:i18n`.
- Translate contextually, not literally. Preserve `{placeholders}` and machine-contract English.
- `useI18n()` only inside `setup()`; elsewhere `i18n.global.t`. Details: [docs/i18n.md](../../docs/i18n.md).
